{"id":188078,"global_id":"Z2lkOi8vaGFja2Vyb25lL1JlcG9ydC8xODgwNzg=","url":"https://hackerone.com/reports/188078","title":"Command Execution because of extension handling","state":"Closed","substate":"duplicate","severity_rating":"high","readable_substate":"Duplicate","created_at":"2016-12-03T20:49:12.765Z","submitted_at":"2016-12-03T20:49:12.765Z","is_member_of_team?":false,"is_organization_group_member?":false,"is_triager?":false,"reporter":{"disabled":false,"username":"paulos__","url":"/paulos__","profile_picture_urls":{"small":"https://profile-photos.hackerone-user-content.com/variants/000/008/601/abf2077609ef0546be8676abd1bec49aaefc9ff2_original.png/dd1dfc8fc7352772e4a8994c07e1d628d34edc74db48377c707f10829dc23d53"},"is_me?":false,"cleared":false,"verified":true,"hackerone_triager":false,"hacker_mediation":false},"team":{"id":15688,"url":"https://hackerone.com/brave","handle":"brave","profile_picture_urls":{"small":"https://profile-photos.hackerone-user-content.com/variants/000/015/688/2aad5641af643ee4f4402896e4747293f6e9c5ca_original.png/dd1dfc8fc7352772e4a8994c07e1d628d34edc74db48377c707f10829dc23d53","medium":"https://profile-photos.hackerone-user-content.com/variants/000/015/688/2aad5641af643ee4f4402896e4747293f6e9c5ca_original.png/2a499a0b732abf809ef45635d9ad400431480fafd17452e700cbdba6fd64fe85"},"permissions":[],"submission_state":"open","default_currency":"usd","awards_miles":false,"offers_bounties":true,"state":"public_mode","only_cleared_hackers":false,"pentest_feature_enabled?":false,"pentest_retesting_ends_at":null,"profile":{"name":"Brave Software","twitter_handle":"brave","website":"https://brave.com","about":""}},"has_bounty?":false,"can_view_team":true,"can_view_report":true,"is_external_bug":false,"is_published":false,"is_participant":false,"has_collaborators":false,"submitted_by_team_member":false,"submitted_with_assistant":false,"stage":4,"public":true,"visibility":"full","cve_ids":[],"singular_disclosure_disabled":true,"disclosed_at":"2017-08-10T05:10:31.716Z","bug_reporter_agreed_on_going_public_at":"2017-07-23T22:15:06.507Z","team_member_agreed_on_going_public_at":"2017-08-10T05:10:31.679Z","comments_closed?":false,"facebook_team?":false,"team_private?":false,"vulnerability_information":"\n## Summary:\n\nHello,\n\nUsing this bug an attacker can execute commands as the current user using brave \u0026 gain complete shell capabilities (and all possibilities associated) \n\n## Details:\n\nThe issue is in the way the application handles website TLDs. typically in windows, `.com` represents an application, much similar like `.exe` - when Brave saves a website (Ctrl+S) - it uses the name of the website.\n\nFor PoC purpose I used `.bat` TLDs because they are much easier to show a poc with instead of binary application garbage data. \n\nSo Assume a user visits http://paulos.bat with the contents of:\n```js\n@echo off\ncalc\n```\n\nAnd saves the page, this will save the website as `paulos.bat` - which when executed - actually opens batch and executes calculator.\n\n## Bypassing Mitigations\n\nIn Windows, Microsoft warns users when they execute applications that are downloaded, this can simply be bypassed by sending filenames with words like `Update` or `Setup`... yeah, I can't believe this works too.\n\nSo say a user visits `https://malicioussetup.com` and saves the site - note this site changed its contents from whatever it was to binary-garbage \u0026 microsoft will allow executing it - eventually causing code execution.\n\nThis is clearly a chain of low priority issues that cause command execution. :) (POC \n\n## Products affected: \n\n * Tested in Latest Brave Windows (I suspect OSX, iOS \u0026 Android may also be affected)\n\n## Recommended Fix:\n\n Add .html/htm to the index page (/index.html) to mitigate this easily\n\n## Supporting Material/References:\n\n  * POC image attached\n  * POC video (Private): https://youtu.be/ret4pJArYSU\n\nI think you should fix this ASAP! as anyone can register `.com` sites to abuse it.\n\nThanks,\nPaulos","weakness":{"id":58,"name":"Command Injection - Generic"},"original_report_id":182557,"original_report_url":"https://hackerone.com/reports/182557","attachments":[{"id":140157,"file_name":"win7poc.JPG","expiring_url":"https://hackerone-us-west-2-production-attachments.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/000/140/157/e4d1acd505d3f86d1b5700a5191a76af095b9529/win7poc.JPG?response-content-disposition=attachment%3B%20filename%3D%22win7poc.JPG%22%3B%20filename%2A%3DUTF-8%27%27win7poc.JPG\u0026response-content-type=image%2Fjpeg\u0026X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256\u0026X-Amz-Credential=[REDACTED_AWS_KEY]%2F20261104%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request\u0026X-Amz-Date=20261104T181458Z\u0026X-Amz-Expires=3600\u0026X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEOj%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJHMEUCIQCDWs499X8882vtLWo4CkJDhPHqamwmFEPeVyVBUDpipAIgS%2BfncZUkIQL3J7NxF6Kc%2F9RaNnk8B83PeSgATIjwcV4qugUIsf%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARADGgwwMTM2MTkyNzQ4NDkiDLmn1JcjmjaruNjK7iqOBZuEZ9qSY8%2B9Kt%2F4lfyhH%2B40ZK7QHmcmji%2FBpoegQBOjzrEOKTMuEfOZdi8HAIND8XGhoW9RE2Ya3S%2ByUa8rAvtlrJhFPCGlKzi5EfCfifdTDvxA4ycBJwr%2FERnvDJuEl2ZA9QqyD%2FkcCxCsJRJxRBTI8vttevOsRf%2FV4qOY8jKRGfMo4fUB%2FoSr5fH8rvxd73W5uTcN6Y7qgBQKPaONkjwOmBNKCMitfZQdVFCgKT2bzW5ZZaoOS4moK6c6l2GK8nGUJZ6eyXNvA7VX1zQbSu6vd3HFhODmVueilW7k6IqMTBB6boEfJuvo3hjzn5JFFU19ZZuL%2BbXcIIAm44TNe41vtfox7qr2%2FhX1UNLs7PLFPIIGpmUxX0Rf90MOWsfFDjSig7tAfKtpZd7VKS24D%2FUTY6%2FB8Yi1v3UH6xX4VXWyno51%2BSVKqoDxGvMBRKz4xFQxG75uLh0b%2F6k7kXY9rJV9dlnNLdt3tq4Yit%2BG22lHcXNlRilMet%2BxOS54loQzdKW3HZeL3Gii48rJmDI6reqdwTYqKAyk5jRc2XPnzGhSpyY7ax6JYCIF%2F6qUC%2BSU%2BI02EBQenC3zpX6UDQmYLdAUI2A2VH66KcxqAktOy%2BUrSRz7kUUWSShMFroWe3DGYMLwqzgj%2BVarqUkuK51rJj82GBrAB5Atxm4UsW%2BYYWM4uCg2fJV4GaMBmznT588DQKHhXMXX0IWYn2CLjvUfbfx0GII5rCWVpFkSoNOUQeNJ4IJKqzs7YYjRbJiT8oLhVJd728160wKD9dnOjmSD6w%2B4wtsiyJMqiME26f4KLmnKCQJy19RJ0qzCHzr1lCS2ovzZTTFgCdkzFUcwmsBHeT76bgFRoG2TJ%2BJlm4HXYDCrs63XBjqxAcd7kWSjWad431tLrts5JM2cuOdwYJnIB7%2BHbGxrxbN1sK8UeB1CBR1Hog8FC0b